-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §30 פעילויות בית ספריות: school activities —
-- 125% of the hour value for up to 18 hours a half-year, for every
-- teaching employee under the reform save the principal and a first deputy
-- who is not a homeroom teacher; their kinds and caps; the free day and the
-- stay hour, as in §29; payment on a report the principal approves, in the
-- next month's salary; and pension contributions.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-31`
§ `30 פעילויות בית ספריות`

DECLARE `school role` IS ONE OF
    `the principal`
    `a first deputy who is not a homeroom teacher`
    `another teaching employee`

-- (ג): the activities and the hours of each in a half-year.
@ref akn:art_30__para_c akn:art_30__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_30__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_30__para_c__subpara_3
DECLARE `school activity` IS ONE OF
    `a general school assembly`
    `an individual parents-and-children meeting`
    `an activity after school hours`

GIVEN a IS A `school activity`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours of the activity a half-year at most` a IS
    CONSIDER a
    WHEN `a general school assembly` THEN 4
    WHEN `an individual parents-and-children meeting` THEN 8
    WHEN `an activity after school hours` THEN 6

-- (א)–(ב): who is paid, at what rate, and the cap of 18 hours a half-year,
-- also on what is allotted.
@ref akn:art_30__para_a akn:art_30__para_b
`school-activity hours a half-year at most` MEANS 18
`the school-activity rate` MEANS 125%

GIVEN r IS A `school role`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid for school activities` r IF
    r EQUALS `another teaching employee`

-- The hours paid in a half-year: each activity up to its own cap, all of
-- them up to 18.
GIVEN `hours of each activity` IS A FUNCTION FROM `school activity` TO NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `school-activity hours paid in the half-year` `hours of each activity` IS
    min `school-activity hours a half-year at most`
        (sum (map (GIVEN a YIELD min (`hours of each activity` a) (`hours of the activity a half-year at most` a))
                  (LIST `a general school assembly`, `an individual parents-and-children meeting`, `an activity after school hours`)))

-- (ד)–(ו): on the free day 125%; in place of a stay hour that day 125% and
-- not the stay hour's 100%; if the stay hour is done on another day, both.
-- The base is §31(א)(3)'s, whichever day.
@ref akn:art_30__para_d akn:art_30__para_e akn:art_30__para_f
GIVEN r IS A `school role`, p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pay for a school-activity hour` r p IS
    IF `paid for school activities` r
    THEN `the school-activity rate` TIMES `the hour value for` `a school-activities hour` p
    ELSE 0

DECLARE `section 30 action` IS ONE OF
    `report the school-activity hours done`
    `approve the report`
    `pay the school-activity hours`

-- (ז)–(ח): payment depends on the teacher's report of the hours, approved
-- by the principal; it is made in the salary of the month after the one
-- the hours were done in, if the report was in by the Ministry's deadline.
-- Time is counted in days from the end of the month the hours were done in.
@ref akn:art_30__para_g akn:art_30__para_h
GIVEN `report deadline` IS A NUMBER @desc the day the Ministry set for the report, counted from the end of the month
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 30 action`
DECIDE `paying for school activities` `report deadline` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `report the school-activity hours done`
    WITHIN `report deadline`
    HENCE (PARTY `the school principal`
           MUST  `approve the report`
           HENCE (PARTY `the State`
                  MUST  `pay the school-activity hours`
                  WITHIN 31
                  LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 30(ח): paid in the salary of the next month"))

-- (ט): pension contributions on the pay (5% employer, 5% employee), by the
-- agreement of 17.12.98.
@ref akn:art_30__para_i
`the employer's contribution on school-activity pay` MEANS 5%
`the employee's contribution on school-activity pay` MEANS 5%

-- The three caps of (ג) come to the 18 hours of (א) exactly.
`the caps of (ג) together` MEANS
    sum (map `hours of the activity a half-year at most`
             (LIST `a general school assembly`, `an individual parents-and-children meeting`, `an activity after school hours`))
#ASSERT `the caps of (ג) together` EQUALS `school-activity hours a half-year at most`

GIVEN a IS A `school activity`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `ten hours of each` a IS 10

#ASSERT `school-activity hours paid in the half-year` `ten hours of each` EQUALS 18

`a teacher at school activities` MEANS
    `pay for the hour value` WITH
        `combined salary`             IS 7794
        `special-education allowance` IS 0
        `pensionable role allowances` IS 779.4
        `a special-education teacher substituting in a special-education class` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `pay for a school-activity hour` `another teaching employee` `a teacher at school activities` EQUALS 68.75
#ASSERT `pay for a school-activity hour` `the principal` `a teacher at school activities` EQUALS 0

#TRACE `paying for school activities` 10 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the teaching employee` DOES `report the school-activity hours done` AT 5
    PARTY `the school principal` DOES `approve the report` AT 7
    PARTY `the State` DOES `pay the school-activity hours` AT 30
